    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "SUMMER SCHEDULES\nSABENA\nBELGIAN World AIRLINES\nmagritte\nEFFECTIVE DATES\nAPR. 1, 1969 THROUGH\nOCT. 31, 1969\nSABENA\nBELGIAN World AIRLINES",
      "Europe begins in Brussels and Sabena fies there every day.\nEUROPE -MIDDLE EAST\nSABENA\nCASARIANCA\nDENVER\nMILWAUKEE CIEVELAN\nKANSAS CITY\nLOS ANGELES\nDALLAS\nSABENA SALES OFFICES\nIN NORTH AMFRICA\nAFRICA\nFunny,\nyou dont look Belgian.\nSabena's magnificent Boeing 707 jets are made in the U.S.A.\ncompletely comfortable. And that goes for economy class as\nBut when it comes to courtesyand food and comfort, there's\nwell as first class.\nnothing better than service in the grand old-world Belgian\nSabena flies to Brussels every night. Three times a night in\nthe summer. More than any other airline. The next time you\nPlenty of superb Belgian cuisine. Unequalled anywhere.\nwant to fly to Brussels, why wait. Get there the instant you\nPrepared with that special Belgian touch, by a master chef\nboard your Sabena jet at John\nwho's right on board your jet.\nF. Kennedy International Air-\nPlenty of genuine old-world Belgian courtesyand service,\nport. Make your travel arrange-\ntoo. Including the services of stewards and stewardesses who\nments with your travel agent or\nknow about everything from selecting wines to making you\ncall Sabena.\nEurope begins in Brussels and Sabena flies there every day.\nEvery dollar paid to Sabena is spent in the V.S.4."
    ],
